title: "Psilocybin for Depressive and Anxiety Disorders - thesis"
abstract: >
  This repository documents the bibliometric arm of a hybrid bibliometric and meta-analytic study on psilocybin for depressive and anxiety disorders. It contains the systematic-review protocol, search strategy documentation, deduplication workflow, derived corpus, figures, and supporting tables. The complete bibliometric section is available on Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21893380.
